  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the following works: TG1 (Lime x 4) - fell to near ground level and treat stumps.\r\n\r\nInsufficient evidence has been provided to demonstrate, on the balance of probabilities, that these trees are the cause of the alleged subsidence. Whilst lime roots were identified at foundation level and the trees may be an influencing factor, the submitted investigations do not confirm soil desiccation and alternative causes of the damage have not been fully explored or ruled out. Furthermore, the trees make a significant contribution to the character and appearance of the Woodford Broadway Conservation Area, and their removal would result in unacceptable harm to local visual amenity."
